WEBVTT

1
00:00:06.267 --> 00:00:11.258
Vinnie and Mandy stood by the front door with their parents.

2
00:00:11.259 --> 00:00:15.774
Mom was taking them shopping for new school clothes.

3
00:00:15.775 --> 00:00:20.541
"What will you do, honey?" Mom asked Dad.

4
00:00:20.542 --> 00:00:24.782
"Don't worry about me." He smiled.

5
00:00:24.783 --> 00:00:27.896
"I'll be working on my den."

6
00:00:27.897 --> 00:00:31.472
Vinnie and Mandy looked at each other.

7
00:00:31.473 --> 00:00:36.861
"Do you have to do it now, Dad?" Mandy asked.

8
00:00:36.862 --> 00:00:40.145
She had left the album on a shelf.

9
00:00:40.146 --> 00:00:43.107
He would certainly see it.

10
00:00:43.108 --> 00:00:45.496
"Why shouldn't I?

11
00:00:45.497 --> 00:00:48.789
You'll be out," replied Dad.

12
00:00:48.790 --> 00:00:51.656
He opened the front door for them.

13
00:00:51.657 --> 00:00:55.411
"But . . . ," whined Mandy.

14
00:00:55.412 --> 00:00:58.857
"What's the matter?" asked Mom.

15
00:00:58.858 --> 00:01:02.032
"You love to go shopping."

16
00:01:02.033 --> 00:01:06.071
"I know, but . . . ," said Mandy.

17
00:01:06.072 --> 00:01:10.300
"We need a miracle," Vinnie whispered.

18
00:01:10.301 --> 00:01:15.456
"What did you say?" asked Mom.

19
00:01:15.457 --> 00:01:19.415
The phone suddenly rang, and Dad answered it.

20
00:01:19.416 --> 00:01:22.755
"It's your mother," he said to Mom.

21
00:01:22.756 --> 00:01:25.676
"I'll just be a minute, kids.

22
00:01:25.677 --> 00:01:28.906
Wait in the car," Mom said.

23
00:01:28.907 --> 00:01:35.315
"Well, okay," said Mandy, feeling a bit uncertain.

24
00:01:35.316 --> 00:01:38.442
Vinnie winked at Mandy and said,

25
00:01:38.443 --> 00:01:42.556
"Uh, I left something upstairs.

26
00:01:42.557 --> 00:01:44.734
I'll be right back."

27
00:01:44.735 --> 00:01:48.887
"Me too!" Mandy added quickly.

28
00:01:48.888 --> 00:01:51.817
They both ran upstairs.

29
00:01:51.818 --> 00:01:55.214
"I think those kids are hiding something,"

30
00:01:55.215 --> 00:01:58.334
Dad muttered to himself.

31
00:01:58.335 --> 00:02:04.187
When they got to the attic, the children let out a long sigh.

32
00:02:04.188 --> 00:02:07.652
"I was so scared he'd find this,"

33
00:02:07.653 --> 00:02:11.982
Mandy said as she took the album from the shelf.

34
00:02:11.983 --> 00:02:16.002
"We don't have a lot of time," Vinnie said.

35
00:02:16.003 --> 00:02:19.053
"Do you want to go on a trip now?"

36
00:02:19.054 --> 00:02:21.125
Mandy nodded.

37
00:02:21.126 --> 00:02:25.761
"But hurry! Mom won't be on the phone long."

38
00:02:25.762 --> 00:02:28.567
Vinnie opened the album.

39
00:02:28.568 --> 00:02:34.789
The old man was standing by a table with a small black machine on it.

40
00:02:34.790 --> 00:02:41.320
A woman was holding something and it was glowing.

41
00:02:41.321 --> 00:02:46.005
"It looks like a sewing machine," remarked Mandy.

42
00:02:46.006 --> 00:02:48.888
"But what's glowing?"

43
00:02:48.889 --> 00:02:51.634
Vinnie looked at the photo.

44
00:02:51.635 --> 00:02:55.311
"Some kind of curtain, I think."

45
00:02:55.312 --> 00:03:03.556
Before he could look more closely, the children fell down the dark tunnel.

46
00:03:03.557 --> 00:03:09.645
Mandy landed on soft grass, and Vinnie fell beside her.

47
00:03:09.646 --> 00:03:12.720
A crowd was gathered nearby.

48
00:03:12.721 --> 00:03:14.324
"Where are we?"

49
00:03:14.325 --> 00:03:18.123
Mandy asked, dusting off her clothes.

50
00:03:18.124 --> 00:03:22.263
She wore a pretty pink dress with ribbons.

51
00:03:22.264 --> 00:03:25.454
Vinnie looked down at his pants.

52
00:03:25.455 --> 00:03:28.288
They came just to his knees.

53
00:03:28.289 --> 00:03:31.829
He wore long socks and black shoes.

54
00:03:31.830 --> 00:03:33.458
"I don't know,"

55
00:03:33.459 --> 00:03:39.169
Vinnie began, but he was interrupted by music.

56
00:03:39.170 --> 00:03:42.759
The children ran to join the crowd.

57
00:03:42.760 --> 00:03:48.551
Everyone was standing in front of a very large, carved marble arch.

58
00:03:48.552 --> 00:03:53.348
Behind the arch was a huge building with many columns.

59
00:03:53.349 --> 00:03:58.986
"The flag on that arch looks familiar," said Mandy.

60
00:03:58.987 --> 00:04:03.018
"Mandy!" Vinnie cried excitedly.

61
00:04:03.019 --> 00:04:05.565
"I think we're in—"

62
00:04:05.566 --> 00:04:10.441
Before Vinnie could finish, someone grabbed Mandy.

63
00:04:10.442 --> 00:04:14.934
"There you are!" a young woman shouted.

64
00:04:14.935 --> 00:04:20.656
"I've been looking everywhere for you!"
